Title: Choose Your Origin
Subtitle: Choose a starting class. You can switch classes later.
NotSelected: No Origin Selected
SelectHint: Select one of the classes above.
DescriptionHint: Each class offers a different combat style.
PotentialHint: Each class possesses a unique Potential ability.
ChargeTitle: Charging Method
MottoTitle: Origin Motto
WeaponTitle: Choose Starting Weapon
WeaponHint: Choose one. Future weapon use is unrestricted.
WeaponOne: Starting Weapon Option I
WeaponTwo: Starting Weapon Option II
WeaponUnassigned: Starting weapons are not yet configured.

Classes: {
	Warrior: {
		Role: Melee · Balanced Offense and Defense
		Description: Excel in close combat with swords, axes, and spears.
		Potential: Potential ability details are not yet available.
		Charge: Build Potential energy through active attacks.
		Motto: Let the blade guide your way; though the path be strewn with thorns, march onward without fear.
	}

	Rogue: {
		Role: Agility · Stealth and Daggers
		Description: Fight with stealth, daggers, and agile tactics.
		Potential: Potential ability details are not yet available.
		Charge: Build Potential energy through active attacks.
		Motto: Slip through the fissures of fate, and teach even those who claim eternity to dread their final dawn.
	}

	Ranger: {
		Role: Ranged · Bows and Firearms
		Description: Fight at range using bows, crossbows, and firearms.
		Potential: Potential ability details are not yet available.
		Charge: Build Potential energy through active attacks.
		Motto: Let gunfire roar and myriad arrows fly; with flame and a storm of arrows, shatter that brittle order.
	}

	Thrower: {
		Role: Ranged · Throwing Specialist
		Description: Specialize in thrown weapons and agile combat.
		Potential: Potential ability details are not yet available.
		Charge: Build Potential energy through active attacks.
		Motto: Let this single throw scream across a thousand miles and tear through the sea of clouds; let it pierce the throats of gods themselves.
	}

	Mage: {
		Role: Magic · Spellbooks and Staves
		Description: Master different casting styles and magical weapons.
		Potential: Potential ability details are not yet available.
		Charge: Build Potential energy through active attacks.
		Motto: Hear the whispers of the stars, seek the origins of all creation; with words of truth, question the gods themselves.
	}

	Bard: {
		Role: Support · Music and Performance
		Description: Empower allies and wound enemies through music.
		Potential: Ensemble: Two instruments play automatically, and their hits count as perfect.
		Charge: Build Potential energy through note judgments.
		Motto: Let melody mend the sundered sky, and the colors of sound compose creation's final requiem.
	}

	Summoner: {
		Role: Summoning · Combat Synergy
		Description: Command minions while actively joining the fight.
		Potential: Potential ability details are not yet available.
		Charge: Build Potential energy primarily through minion attacks.
		Motto: Should this world deny Them a place, even if the gods forbid it, they shall not prevent the promise from being fulfilled.
	}

	Artificer: {
		Role: Deployment · Sentry Specialist
		Description: Control the battlefield with sentries and deployed devices.
		Potential: Potential ability details are not yet available.
		Charge: Build Potential energy primarily through sentry attacks.
		Motto: Let my inventions lie scattered as I feign defeat; when my foes proclaim victory, they shall learn the ground is strewn with the seeds of my triumph.
	}
}
